Subject: [PATCH] feat(gamafication_metric): add `d3.js animated pie chart` for
 user points

Changes:
- add js, css directly into dashboard.html
- change `GAMMA_PROPERTIES` structure: `API_URL` should contains basic API url w/o `gamma-profile`
- API request from browser uses `GAMMA_PROPERTIES`

TODO:
- move js, css into includable files

feat(dashboard): add animated rind to render user rewards by category

makrup(dashboard): fix markup for gamification widgets

markup(dashboard.html): add combined category/points half/donut `highcharts ` widget, progress, accumulative progress widgets, badges

markup(dashboard): add second YAxis for accumulative graph
